  "note": "A census of the S-DD1 streams in Street Fighter Zero 2 (Japan), read from a table that a DMA trace of the retail cartridge produced, and a check of that table against the indexed census of the USA build. Header bytes, lengths and counts only. No compressed byte and no decompressed byte is recorded here, and none can be recovered from this.",
