    "howItWasMade": "The retail Japanese cartridge run under snes9x with the S-DD1 emulated, logging every DMA whose A-bus address is fixed, which is the condition the chip decompresses under, with each entry then decompressed out of the retail image to its recorded length. The table's own header says so, and says the set is a floor: a stream nobody asked for during the run cannot be in it."
  },
  "agreementMeans": "identical counts the traced streams whose expansion, at the traced length, is byte for byte the expansion of a stream in the USA table read from the indexing re-release. control moves every traced start one byte on and counts again, which is what coincidence scores.",
